# All optional. Copy to .env and export, or set in your shell.
# Where videos, exports, temp files and the SQLite database live.
CLIPPER_STORAGE=./storage
# Where faster-whisper keeps downloaded models (default: the Hugging Face cache).
# CLIPPER_WHISPER_DIR=./storage/models
# whisper.cpp program used when faster-whisper is not installed (default: whisper-cli on the PATH, or
# ./whisper.cpp/build/bin/whisper-cli which scripts/termux.sh builds). Its models go in storage/models.
# CLIPPER_WHISPER_CPP=/path/to/whisper-cli
# AI rating of the top clip candidates is set up in the app: Settings > AI clip rating.
# These are only a fallback for running without the Settings page; a key saved in Settings wins.
# CLIPPER_LLM_KEY=your-key
# CLIPPER_LLM_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest
# CLIPPER_LLM_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
